bytes allocated   609
peak live bytes   609
instructions      1255
binary size       5000 bytes (code 2532, data 130, metadata 2338)

function                calls  code bytes
__ctor$Tagged$Nums          3         192
__to_str_Tagged             3        1184
aipl_arr_inc                6    external
aipl_array_dec              6    external
aipl_i64_len               10    external
aipl_write_bytes           17    external
aipl_write_i64              5    external
applied                     3         536
main                        1         620
